{"id":"7d587862ea5b2e8b","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-seq-subsequence.md","title":"ZFC Seq Subsequence","display":"df-zfc-seq-subsequence — ZFC Seq Subsequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-seq-subsequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-seq-subsequence"],"display":"df-zfc-seq-subsequence — ZFC Seq Subsequence","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-seq-subsequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-seq-subsequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-seq-subsequence — ZFC Seq Subsequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,\\pi\\in V\">\\(s,t,\\pi\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSubsequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSubsequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a> 定义的序数类。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}subsequence}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSubsequence}_S(t,s,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X\\;\\left(\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\operatorname{dom}(s),X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t,\\operatorname{dom}(t),X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,\\operatorname{dom}(t),\\operatorname{dom}(s))\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\;(\\pi(i)&lt;\\pi(j))\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\;(t(i)=s(\\pi(i)))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}subsequence}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSubsequence}_S(t,s,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X\\;\\left(\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\operatorname{dom}(s),X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t,\\operatorname{dom}(t),X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,\\operatorname{dom}(t),\\operatorname{dom}(s))\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\;(\\pi(i)&lt;\\pi(j))\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\;(t(i)=s(\\pi(i)))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both sequences and the index map are typed, and strict increase is expanded directly.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · d